<title>RUSSIA: Sayansk Aluminium back to profit in 95.</title>
<headline>Sayansk Aluminium back to profit in 95.</headline>
<dateline>SAYANOGORSK, Russia 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31.</p>
<p>						    1995	1994</p>
<p>    Net profit (billions of roubles)    18.2	 7.5 loss</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			   207.2	47.8</p>
<p>    Value of production		  1,439.0     673.5</p>
<p>    Capital investment			40.2	37.8</p>
<p>    Aluminium output (thousand tonnes) 314.6     284.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name OAO Sayansky Alyuminiyevy Zavod. No sales figures. Profit figures positive except for 1994 net.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
